<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cen bank sets o/n repo, limit rate 14.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cen bank sets o/n repo, limit rate 14.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) set an overnight repo tender on Thursday with a limit rate of 14.9 percent to add liquidity.</p>
<p>At the last overnight repo, on July 25, the limit rate was set at 15.2 percent.</p>
<p>Up to two bids will be accepted in the American- style operation at a minimum of 100 million crowns ($2.9 million) each.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003 ($ = 34.38 Czech Crowns)</p>
</text>
